## Boundary

- **Per-host detection + per-tool router** (this rule) → points at the
  right reference for the current trigger.
- **fnm mechanics** (version detection, install, fallback, corepack,
  not-installed recommendation) → the `fnm` section below.
- **Container runtime selection** (shim detection, compose variant, OCI
  vs Docker Hub, not-installed recommendation) → `container-tools`
  skill.
- **Per-project conventions** (lockfile policy, multi-stage build
  patterns) → not a rule; defer to project conventions.
- **Adding a new runtime tool in the future** (e.g. `uv`, `mise`,
  `rtk`-in-router) → create a new flat skill, add a new trigger line
  to this rule. No edits to existing skills; no parent description to
  grow.